# NST Release & Security

## Auto-activate

- `nst-release-engineer` for VERSION, CHANGELOG, spec, pytest, enterprise QA gate
- `nst-security-ops` for credential APIs, `/api/execute`, VLAN/IM deploy routes

## Pre-ship

```bash
python -m pytest tests/ -q && python _prebuild.py
```

## Vendor matrix

Validate mentally: Cisco IOS/XE, NX-OS, Juniper Junos for any adapter or CLI change.

Never commit or log secrets. Outputs → `utils/output_paths.py` only.
